1
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:48,260
Your sea of consciousness is sealed.

2
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,790
Now you can only rely on yourself to unseal it.

3
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:55,090
I can only send you in for the time it takes an incense stick to burn.

4
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:57,900
Understood.

5
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:03,400
Inside the sea of consciousness,

6
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:05,400
flesh and blood are no different from the mortal world.

7
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,560
If you die or get injured,

8
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,530
I am not responsible.

9
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:08,600
If you don't return when the incense burns out,

10
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,260
your soul will be trapped inside forever.

11
00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:11,320
You must remember,

12
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,030
to pass,

13
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,800
and break your inner demons.

14
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,420
My wife, you're finally here.

15
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,820
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

16
00:02:21,100 --> 00:02:21,760
Cangyuan.

17
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:23,800
Why are you here?

18
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:29,560
I'll follow you wherever you go, my wife.

19
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,690
We are inseparable.

20
00:02:32,430 --> 00:02:33,400
Didn't I tell you

21
00:02:33,730 --> 00:02:35,130
not to follow me anymore?

22
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,760
You are so cruel, my wife.

23
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:39,990
You really left just like that.

24
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:42,060
I waited by the lake for three days,

25
00:02:42,060 --> 00:02:43,590
and there was no sign of you.

26
00:02:43,930 --> 00:02:44,860
I thought to myself,

27
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:47,060
my wife can't just disappear like this.

28
00:02:47,530 --> 00:02:49,190
So I searched all the way here.

29
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,090
Your injuries are healed?

30
00:02:54,430 --> 00:02:55,200
After you left,

31
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,130
I found a doctor,

32
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:57,100
applied medicine for three days,

33
00:02:57,100 --> 00:02:57,900
and they are all healed.

34
00:02:57,900 --> 00:02:58,230
Look,

35
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,130
there's not a single scar left.

36
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,200
Don't run around alone anymore.

37
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,460
It's dangerous outside.

38
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:04,030
After you left,

39
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:05,060
I couldn't eat

40
00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:06,100
or sleep every day.

41
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:07,700
Look, haven't I lost weight?

42
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,060
You are not Cangyuan.

43
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:16,100
My wife,

44
00:03:16,700 --> 00:03:18,230
what are you talking about?

45
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,500
Where are your injuries?

46
00:03:33,030 --> 00:03:34,030
Didn't I tell you?

47
00:03:34,230 --> 00:03:35,490
The doctor cured them.

48
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:37,730
When I applied medicine for you,

49
00:03:37,730 --> 00:03:39,360
three inches below your shoulder blade,

50
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,760
there was a cut this long.

51
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:44,500
I used half a bottle of powder to stop the bleeding.

52
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,600
You also have a cut from waterweeds,

53
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:49,500
left when you saved the deer at Qiyue Lake that day.

54
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:53,190
These injuries couldn't heal so quickly.

55
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,160
You are not Cangyuan.

56
00:03:58,730 --> 00:04:00,760
That fool would even burn porridge.

57
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:04,930
What doctor could make him obediently apply medicine for three days?

58
00:04:04,930 --> 00:04:06,460
You imitate him quite well,

59
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:09,600
but you don't remember what injuries he suffered.

60
00:04:10,530 --> 00:04:11,430
I am him,

61
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,930
the one you are thinking of.

62
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:15,960
After you left,

63
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:18,459
you've been thinking about him,

64
00:04:18,459 --> 00:04:19,190
haven't you?

65
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,360
Shut up.

66
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:25,320
You know in your heart,

67
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,630
you left him because you were afraid of dragging him down.

68
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:29,900
But you've been regretting it since you left.

69
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:32,260
You thought of him when you squatted at the street corner in Anyang City,

70
00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:34,130
and when you were sold to the brothel.

71
00:04:34,130 --> 00:04:36,030
When you got the stone piece and came to Shiyi Pavilion,

72
00:04:36,030 --> 00:04:37,300
your first thought was to tell him.

73
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:38,260
Dare you deny it?

74
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:46,420
Don't even try to lie to me.

75
00:04:56,030 --> 00:04:57,760
You are smarter than I thought.

76
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,960
This is only the first trial.

77
00:05:24,730 --> 00:05:26,100
This is the last trial.

78
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:33,760
Li'er.

79
00:05:36,430 --> 00:05:37,030
Who is it?

80
00:05:37,530 --> 00:05:38,790
You don't remember me?

81
00:05:39,430 --> 00:05:40,230
I am Zhaohan.

82
00:05:41,200 --> 00:05:41,760
I am

83
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:43,030
your husband.
